y and carcinogenicity in animals and humans</article-title><source>Mol. Nutr. Food Res</source><year>2007</year><volume>51</volume><fpage>61</fpage><lpage>99</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17195275</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b7-ijms-10-00037"><label>7.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sava</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Reunova</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name><name><surname>Velasques</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Harbison</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>S&#x000e1;nchez-Ramos</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Acute neurotoxic effects of the fungal metabolite ochratoxin &#x02013;A</article-title><source>Neuro. Toxicol</source><year>2006</year><volume>27</volume><fpage>82</fpage><lpage>92</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="b8-ijms-10-00037"><label>8.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>M&#x00171;ller</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Kielstein</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>K&#x00151;hler</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Berndt</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Rosner</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Studies of the influence of ochratoxin A on immune and defence reactions in the mouse model</article-title><source>Mycoses</source><year>1995</year><volume>38</volume><fpage>85</fpage><lpage>91</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7637687</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b9-ijms-10-00037"><label>9.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>M&#x00171;ller</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Kielstein</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Rosner</surname><given-names>H</giv